{"@context":["https://ref.gs1.org/standards/epcis/epcis-context.jsonld",{"@version":1.1,"rail":"https://gs1-epcis-reg.org/rail/voc/data#","disco":"https://gs1-epcis-reg.org/disco/voc/data#","schema":"https://schema.org/","dc":"http://purl.org/dc/terms/","xsd":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#","voaf":"http://www.w3.org/ns/voaf#","vann":"https://vocab.org/vann/#"}],"@graph":[{"@id":"rail:","@type":["voaf:Vocabulary","owl:Ontology"],"schema:license":"data:text/html;charset=UTF-8,<p>GS1&reg;, under its IP Policy, seeks to avoid uncertainty regarding intellectual property claims by requiring the participants in the Work Groups that developed this vocabulary to agree to grant to GS1 members a royalty-free licence or a RAND licence to Necessary Claims, as that term is defined in the GS1 IP Policy. Furthermore, attention is drawn to the possibility that an implementation of one or more features of this vocabulary may be the subject of a patent or other intellectual property     right that does not involve a Necessary Claim. Any such patent or other intellectual property right is not subject to the licencing obligations of GS1. Moreover, the agreement to grant licences provided under the GS1 IP Policy does not include IP rights and any claims of third parties who were not participants in the Work Groups. Accordingly, GS1 recommends that any organisation developing an implementation designed to be in conformance with this vocabulary should determine whether there are any     patents that may encompass a specific implementation that the organisation is developing in compliance with the vocabulary and whether a licence under a patent or other intellectual property right is needed. Such a determination of a need for licencing should be made in view of the details of the specific system designed by the organisation in consultation with their own patent counsel. THIS DOCUMENT IS PROVIDED &quot;AS IS&quot; WITH NO WARRANTIES WHATSOEVER, INCLUDING ANY WARRANTY OF MERCHANTABILITY, NONINFRINGMENT, FITNESS FOR PARTICULAR PURPOSE, OR ANY WARRANTY OTHER WISE ARISING OUT OF THIS SPECIFICATION. GS1 disclaims all liability for any damages arising from use or misuse of this vocabulary, whether special, indirect, consequential, or compensatory damages, and including liability for infringement of any intellectual property     rights, relating to use of information in or reliance upon this document. GS1 retains the right to make changes to this vocabulary at any time, without notice. GS1 makes no warranty for the use of this vocabulary and assumes no responsibility for any errors which may appear in the vocabulary, nor does it make a commitment to update the     information contained herein. GS1 and the GS1 logo are registered trademarks of GS1 AISBL.</p><p>Copyright 2015-2019 GS1 AISBL</p><p>Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the &quot;License&quot;); you may not use this file except in compliance with the License. You may obtain a copy of the License at <a href=&quot;http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0&quot; target=&quot;blank&quot;>http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0</a>.<p><p>Unless required by applicable law or agreed to in writing, software distributed under the License is distributed on an &quot;AS IS&quot; BASIS, WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied. See the License for the specific language governing permissions and limitations under the License.</p>","dc:contributors":"Dominik Halbeisen, Benjamin Herzig, Elio Hbeich","dc:creator":{"@id":"https://gs1-epcis-reg.org/"},"dc:description":{"@language":"en","@value":"The GS1 Rail vocabulary, described using W3C RDF Schema and the Web Ontology Language. The vocabulary builds on and refers to schema.org where appropriate."},"dc:identifier":"GS1 Rail Vocabulary","dc11:title":"GS1 Rail Vocabulary","dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-10-23"},"dc:lastModified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-05-07"},"owl:versionInfo":"2.0","vann:preferredNamespacePrefix":"rail","vann:preferredNamespaceUri":{"@id":"rail:"},"voaf:extends":{"@id":"epcis:"}},{"@id":"rail:europeanTrackLocation","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:label":"European Track Location","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"gs1:Place"},"rdfs:range":"xsd:string","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Represents a location label / human readable context submitted by the data provider indicating the location associated with a rail asset or event. The European Track Location is the place where the event occurs (gs1:Place), not the EPCIS readPoint property. Note: The European Location Label is very often composed of either UIC country code + line number + kilometer or station code plus + track number"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:geo","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:label":"Geo coordinates, Lat, Long","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"gs1:Place"},"rdfs:range":"xsd:string","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"A geographic location described by its geo-coordinates in a string latitude,longitude, separated by a comma. Ex. 52.554433,13.398299. The property applies to the place (gs1:Place) where the event occurs, not to the EPCIS readPoint property."},"rdfs:seeAlso":[{"@id":"gs1:geo"},{"@id":"gs1:GeoCoordinates"},{"@id":"gs1:latitude"},{"@id":"gs1:longitude"}],"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:startWarranty","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":"The timestamp for the start of warranty needs to be represented in an xsd:dateTimeStamp format YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS.000+TIME ZONE. Missing values are to be filled with zeros","rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Start date and time of a warranty","rdfs:range":"xsd:dateTime","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"schema:WarrantyPromise"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:functionalStatus","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"The functional status of the trade item may need to be included by the manufacturer to meet regulatory or commercial requirements. For example requirements related to the type approval, allowing the trade item to be sold in a particular country. It is a status definition of a component or asset below GTIN level."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Functional Status below GTIN","rdfs:subPropertyOf":{"@id":"schema:additionalProperty"},"rdfs:domain":{"@id":"schema:Product"},"rdfs:range":"rdf:langString","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:nominalValue","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:label":"Nominal Value","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"The target (as should) value for a parameter, around which tolerances are defined. Used as the reference value for specification limits."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:domain":[{"@id":"schema:Observation"},{"@id":"rail:NominalValueSet"}],"rdfs:range":"xsd:decimal","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:lowerSpecificationLimit","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"The minimum acceptable value for a product or service. If a product's specification is below the LSL, it may not be accepted."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Lower Specification Limit (LSL)","rdfs:domain":[{"@id":"schema:Observation"},{"@id":"rail:NominalValueSet"}],"rdfs:range":"xsd:decimal","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:upperSpecificationLimit","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"The maximum acceptable value for a product or service. If a product's specification is above the USL, it may not be accepted."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Upper Specification Limit (USL)","rdfs:domain":[{"@id":"schema:Observation"},{"@id":"rail:NominalValueSet"}],"rdfs:range":"xsd:decimal","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:softwareCheck","@type":"disco:DataProcessingMethod","rdfs:label":"Software check","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates that the sensor data was processed using a software version verification or validation method. This value is used with epcis:dataProcessingMethod and may be accompanied by schema:softwareVersion in the EPCIS SensorReport."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:NominalValueSet","@type":["owl:Class","rdfs:Class"],"rdfs:label":"Nominal Value Set","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorMetadata"},"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Represents nominal values and specification limits (LSL, USL) for a particular parameter."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:"},{"@id":"rail:setNominalValues","@type":["owl:ObjectProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:label":"Set nominal values","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Links to a set of quantitative definitions for specific measurement parameters, such as axial internal clearance or grease fill."},"rdfs:range":{"@id":"rail:NominalValueSet"},"rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorMetadata"},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:passed","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"A type of SensorValue in EPCIS Sensor Data, that only can have the result passed or not."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Sensor value passed or not","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:MeasurementType"},"rdfs:range":"xsd:boolean","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:sideIndicator","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Side indicator of a rail vehicle as per 'https://www.gs1.org/sites/gs1/files/2023-04/implementation-guide-autoid-in-rail.pdf'. When a data source delivers a side indicator value A or B, then the Discovery Service just maps A to 1 and B to 2."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Side indicator of the rail vehicle","rdfs:range":"xsd:integer","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorMetadata"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:en15654Speed","@type":["owl:ObjectProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Mean speed of vehicle in km/h as defined in EN 15654."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Mean speed of vehicle","schema:unitCode":"KMH","rdfs:range":{"@id":"schema:QuantitativeValue"},"rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorMetadata"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:TypesWTMS","@type":["owl:Class","rdfs:Class"],"rdfs:label":"WTMS Types","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorMetadata"},"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"A class regrouping different types of WTMS measurement stations"}},{"@id":"rail:typeWtms","@type":["owl:ObjectProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Type of measurement installation installed along a track."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"WTMS Type","rdfs:range":"rail:TypesWTMS","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorMetadata"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:typeWtms-WILD","@type":"rail:TypesWTMS","rdfs:label":"Wheel impact load detection","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates the type of WTMS installation to be a wheel impact load detection measurement station by Voestalpine."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:typeWtms-HFO","@type":"rail:TypesWTMS","rdfs:label":"Heat detection","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates the type of WTMS installation to be a bearing and brake temperature measurement station. HFO stands thereby for the German Heisslaufer und Festbremsortung."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:typeWtms-RAILWATCH","@type":"rail:TypesWTMS","rdfs:label":"Railwatch WTMS equipment","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates the type of WTMS installation to be a measurement station installed by Vossloh Railwatch."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:typeWtms-MULTIRAIL","@type":"rail:TypesWTMS","rdfs:label":"Multirail impact load detection system","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates the type of WTMS installation to be a measurement station by Schunk multirail measuring wheel impact load detection."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:typeWtms-RFID","@type":"rail:TypesWTMS","rdfs:label":"RFID captures train passage","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates the type of WTMS installation to be a measurement station only registering the passage of a train based on an RFID reading."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:DynamicCoefficient","@type":["owl:Class","rdf:Class"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"A set of dynamic Coefficient details (normalized axle number, left and right value) of the vehicle."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorMetadata"},"rdfs:label":"Dynamic Coefficient Details","sw:term_status":"deprecated"},{"@id":"rail:dynamicCoefficient","@type":"disco:DataProcessingMethod","rdfs:label":"Dynamic Coefficient","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates that the sensor data report referenced provides dynamic Coefficient measurement details (normalized axle number, left and right value) of the vehicle."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:peakForce","@type":"disco:DataProcessingMethod","rdfs:label":"Peak Force","schema:unitCode":"B47","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates that the sensor data report referenced provides peak force measurement details (normalized axle number, left and right value) of the vehicle, measured in kN of a wheel on a rail, including any dynamic effects due to wheel damage."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:meanForce","@type":"disco:DataProcessingMethod","rdfs:label":"Mean Force","schema:unitCode":"B47","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates that the sensor data report referenced provides mean (“quasi-static”) force measurement details (normalized axle number, left and right value) of the vehicle, measured in kN of a wheel on a rail, i.e. ignoring any dynamic effect due to wheel damage."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:dynForce","@type":"disco:DataProcessingMethod","rdfs:label":"Dynamic Force","schema:unitCode":"B47","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates that the sensor data report referenced provides dynamic force measurement details (normalized axle number, left and right value) of the vehicle, measured in kN as difference between peak and mean force of a wheel"},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:wheelWeight","@type":"disco:DataProcessingMethod","rdfs:label":"Wheel Weight","schema:unitCode":"KGM","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates that the sensor data report referenced provides wheel weight measurement details (normalized axle number, left and right value) of the vehicle, expressed in kg as total mean load on wheel."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:axleLoad","@type":"disco:DataProcessingMethod","rdfs:label":"Axle load","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates that the sensor data report referenced provides total “quasi-static” axle load measurement details (normalized axle number, left and right value) of the vehicle, expressed in tonnes and ignoring any dynamic effect due to wheel damage."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:wheelDamage","@type":"disco:DataProcessingMethod","rdfs:label":"Wheel Damage","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates that the sensor data report referenced provides wheel damage information details (normalized axle number, left and right value) of the vehicle."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:vehicleImbalanceData","@type":"disco:DataProcessingMethod","rdfs:label":"Vehicle imbalance data","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates that the sensor data report referenced provides data on a vehicle's imbalance"},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:bearingTemperature","@type":"disco:DataProcessingMethod","rdfs:label":"Bearing Temperature","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates that the sensor data report referenced provides measurement details in °C on the temperature of bearings (normalized axle number, left and right value) of the vehicle. The temperature is usually measured on the outer side at the bottom."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:wheelTemperature","@type":"disco:DataProcessingMethod","rdfs:label":"Wheel Temperature","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates that the sensor data report referenced provides measurement details in °C on the temperature of wheels (normalized axle number, left and right value) of the vehicle. The temperature is usually measured on the outside at the wheel rim."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:rlRatio","@type":"disco:DataProcessingMethod","rdfs:label":"Right/left wheel weight ratio","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates, based on EN 15654, that the sensor data report referenced provides rail vehicle axle weight distribution measurement details of  the vehicle. It is calculated as follows: Static force of the left side wheel L = Lf; Static force of the right side wheel R = Rf; R/L for the left wheel = Lf/Rf; R/L for the right wheel = Rf/Lf; Example: If Lf = 60kN and Rf = 65kN, then L/R for the left wheel of the respective axle is 60kN/65kN = 0.92"},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:brakeThickness","@type":"disco:DataProcessingMethod","rdfs:label":"Thickness of brakeing pads","schema:unitCode":"MMT","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates the thickness of braking pads measured in mm, used in cargo vehicles in rail"},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:vehicleImage","@type":"disco:DataProcessingMethod","rdfs:label":"Image taken of a vehicle","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Links to an image taken of a passing vehicle"},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:graffitiRecognition","@type":"disco:DataProcessingMethod","rdfs:label":"Graffiti on a vehicle","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Measures the presence of graffiti on a vehicle"},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:WheelDamageType","@type":["owl:Class","rdfs:Class"],"rdfs:label":"Wheel damage type","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"A class regrouping types of wheel damage reported"}},{"@id":"rail:wheelFlat","@type":"rail:WheelDamageType","rdfs:label":"Wheel Flat","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates that measured wheel has a flat spot"},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:outOfRound","@type":"rail:WheelDamageType","rdfs:label":"Wheel out of round","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates that measured wheel is not round"},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:squaring","@type":"rail:WheelDamageType","rdfs:label":"Wheel squaring","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates that measured wheel experiences squaring"},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:normalizedAxle","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"The consecutive number of an rail vehicle's axle as seen when looking at a rail vehicle with its RFID encoded side indicator 1 being first in direction of travel."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Normalized axle number","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"rdfs:range":"xsd:integer","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:leftValue","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"A measurement measured on the left side of the measured object, depending on the context, seen in the direction of travel of a vehicle, rounded up to three decimal places."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Measurement on the left side of the measured object","rdfs:range":"xsd:decimal","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:leftValueString","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"A measurement measured on the left side of the measured object, depending on the context, seen in the direction of travel of a vehicle, expressed as string only."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Measurement on the left side of the measured object","rdfs:range":"rail:WheelDamageType","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:rightValueString","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"A measurement measured on the right side of the measured object, depending on the context, seen in the direction of travel of a vehicle, expressed as string only."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Measurement on the right side of the measured object","rdfs:range":"rail:WheelDamageType","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:rightValue","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"A measurement measured on the right side of the measured object, depending on the context, seen in the direction of travel of a vehicle, rounded up to three decimal places."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Measurement on the right side of the measured object","rdfs:range":"xsd:decimal","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:topValue","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"A measurement measured on the top side of the reference object, depending on the context, rounded up to three decimal places."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Measurement at the top of the measured object","rdfs:range":"xsd:decimal","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:bottomValue","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"A measurement measured at the bottom of the reference object, depending on the context, rounded up to three decimal places."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Measurement at the bottom of the measured object","rdfs:range":"xsd:decimal","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:hasGraffiti","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Indicates as a boolean whether a rail vehicle has graffiti or not"},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Rail vehicle has graffiti","rdfs:range":"xsd:boolean","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:graffitiSize","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"The estimated diagonal of a graffiti measured in mm"},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Graffiti size measurement","schema:unitCode":"MMT","rdfs:range":"xsd:decimal","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:lateralLoadImbalance","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"The ratio of the total mean wheel forces on one side of a vehicle to the other side. The greater of L/R or R/L is used, so that the value is greater than or equal to 1."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Lateral load imbalance","rdfs:range":"xsd:decimal","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:trailingBogieDiagImbalance","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Diagonal load imbalance of trailing bogie."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Trailing bogie diagonal imbalance","rdfs:range":"xsd:decimal","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:combiAxleLoadLongLoadImbal","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Combined axle/longitudinal load imbalance of vehicle, using algorithm developed by Chalmers University."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Combined axle load and longitudinal load imbalance","rdfs:range":"xsd:decimal","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:vehDiagImbal","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Diagonal load imbalance of vehicle."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Vehicle diagional imbalance","rdfs:range":"xsd:decimal","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:leadingBogieDiagImbal","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Diagonal load imbalance of leading bogie."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Leading bogie diagonal imbalance","rdfs:range":"xsd:decimal","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:longLoadImbal","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Longitudinal load imbalance of vehicle."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Longitudinal load imbalance","rdfs:range":"xsd:decimal","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:axleLoadImbal","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Axle load imbalance of vehicle, measured as heavier axle divided by the lighter axle."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Axle load imbalance","rdfs:range":"xsd:decimal","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:grossLadenWeight","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Gross laden weight of a rail vehicle measured in tonnes."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Gross laden weight","schema:unitCode":"TNE","rdfs:range":"xsd:decimal","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:tareWeight","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Tare weight of a rail vehicle measured in tonnes."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Tare weight","schema:unitCode":"TNE","rdfs:range":"xsd:decimal","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:heavySide","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Heavy side of a vehicle."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Heavy side of a vehicle","rdfs:range":{"@id":"rail:HeavierSide"},"rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:HeavierSide","@type":["owl:Class","rdfs:Class"],"rdfs:label":"Heavier side","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"A class describing which side of a rail vehicle is heavier"}},{"@id":"rail:leftTrav","@type":"rail:HeavierSide","rdfs:label":"Left side in travelling direction","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Left in direction of travel"},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:rightTrav","@type":"rail:HeavierSide","rdfs:label":"Right side in travelling direction","rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Right in direction of travel"},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:Manufacturer","@type":["owl:Class","rdf:Class"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"The group of details about a manufacturer."},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Manufacturer","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"gs1:Organization"},"sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:itemReconditioningDate","@type":["owl:DatatypeProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"The date an item has been refurbished and became again fit for purpose"},"rdfs:isDefinedBy":"rail:","rdfs:label":"Item reconditioning date","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"schema:Product"},"rdfs:range":"xsd:dateTime","sw:term_status":"stable"},{"@id":"rail:railRunDistance","@type":["owl:ObjectProperty","rdf:Property"],"rdfs:label":"Run Distance","schema:unitCode":"KMT","rdfs:domain":{"@id":"epcis:SensorReport"},"rdfs:range":{"@id":"schema:QuantitativeValue"},"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"It is the distance a rail vehicle has run in total from a point in time set in the past (usually the time a Vehicle was first put into service up until the time the run distance is provided"},"sw:term_status":"stable"}]}
